v class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\td.&#160;&#160;&#160;The required lengths shall be doubled for gypsum board applied to only one face of a braced wall panel.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-182306\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-182306\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\te.&#160;&#160;&#160;Percentage shown represents the minimum amount of bracing required along the building length (or wall length if the structure has an irregular shape).<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
